<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 9,056 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 1,000 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  181   (202 and 177)</p>
<p>    Good		125   (130 and 150)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     118   (125 and 125)</p>
<p>    Medium	    109   (114 and 100)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	unq   (unq and  85)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 181 pence for a Rwanda PF1</p>
</text>
